  hockey techniques like luffy did if  luffy didn't learn to emit his hockey he  would not have been able to hurt kaido  without physically touching him and so  he would have had no chance against this  form and it's notable that luffy only  managed to take kaido down after he  awoke his fruit and we discovered that  in fact he too had a god fruit the  entire time it took a god fruit to beat  another god fruit in this case which  makes sense so now let's take a look at  this god fruit that helped luffy to beat  the so-called strongest creature in the  world although it was once thought to be  a paramecia called the gomugomi it was  relatively recently revealed that this  fruit is actually a mythical zone called  the hitohito nomi model nika aka the  human human fruit model nika it derives  its name from the sun god nikka and when  the five elders are talking about it  they even say that this particular fruit  has the name of a god but until it is  awakened aka until luffy unlocked gear 5  it primarily possessed the properties of  rubber and so the government succeeded  in keeping its true nature largely under  wraps by labeling it as a harmless  paramecium the government has been  trying to get it for over 800 years but  as a zone with a will of its own the  fruit has been escaping their grasp all  this time once they almost had it before  shanks took it away again and eventually  brought it to where luffy ate it the  five elders described the myth of nika  as follows and i quote possessing a body  with the properties of rubber and  fighting in whatever way he fancies  bringing smiles to the faces of the  people the warrior of liberation also  known as nika the sun god awakening  brings his rubbery body greater physical  strength and freedom it is said that in  all the world there is no power more  ridiculous end quote if you want a  rundown of all of luffy's gears we also  made a video about that but here i'll be  focusing on the awakened gear 5 since it  is the true nature of this god fruit in  this gear luffy is able to tunify  himself and those around him to an  unprecedented degree he's able to grow  his fists large enough so that he can  grab kaido's giant dragon body as if it  was a garden snake as he pulls kaido  kaido's eyes pop out from his head like  in the old cartoons luffy can  effortlessly swing around the giant  dragon banging him into the ground over  and over again not only can he tunify  himself and others he can also tunified  the world around him in one case he  turns the ground to rubber and pulls it  up to deflect tidal's blast breath luffy  is even able to fight kaido from the  inside out and in one instance he brings  his hands out through the back of  kaido's eyes in order to grab his nose  it should be noted that this would  seemingly be much more deadly for kaido  if luffy's powers weren't active and  allowing kaido's body and eyes to  stretch in such impossible and  cartoonish ways but it's all part of  gear 5 luffy having fun at one point  luffy becomes so big that he can use  kaido's giant dragon body as a jump rope  he survives the full brunt of a blast  breath and even flies through the air  after it by moving his legs really  quickly again just like in the old  cartoons he avoids taking heavy damage  from kaido's kanabo by becoming  extremely stretchy to the point where  his nose and tongue take the exact shape  of the spikes of the kanabo he then  dampens the attack of another strike by  making the floor beneath him rubbery he  even punches kaido through the face but  because of toon logic kaido's face is  whole when the attack is finished i hope  it still delivered insane damage though  luffy keeps doing entertaining stuff  throughout the fight like catching  lightning and then throwing it like zeus  using it as a pole to spin around and  even creating a giant hockey infused  fist that even makes kaido's dragon body  look small however oda is not going to  let luffy's victory just be the result  of his devil fruit he has kaido point  out that the best fighters are masters  of haki haki is so important that many  of the strongest characters in the  series didn't even need devil fruits  because their hockey was so strong kaido  then takes the form of the flame dragon  we already discussed and luffy has to  combine his devil fruit power with his  haki mastery in order to actually hit  kaido without touching him and that's  what we saw from the sun god fruit so  far but chances are this is only the tip  of the iceberg since this fruit  represents the freedom to fight however  one fancies still i like the fact that  no matter how ridiculous the fruit is  it's made clear that it's practically  useless without hockey mastery so even  though the fruit seems overpowered luffy  can still continue to become stronger by  improving his mastery over haki which  will arguably be the most important  aspect to him becoming the pirate king  it should also be noted that the sun god  nika figure is a symbol of hope and  liberation for the oppressed and that is  why the government is especially scared  of it it's not just about strength its  very existence may inspire the people of  the world to rise up against the world  government next we turn to the other  mythical human human fruit the hitohito  no me model daibutsu aka the human human  fruit model buddha daibutsu means giant  buddha or great buddha now when we think  about deities of different world  religions we usually think of the buddha  but it should be noted that the buddha  is not actually considered a god in  buddhism still though the buddha is the  central figure we associate with the  religion and you can find golden buddhas  and temples and other places of worship  so for me personally i can see putting  this into the god fruit category as well  the hype fruit also goes to a very hyped  character namely the former fleet  admiral sengoku it's a fruit that even  stands out among the other op fruits the  admirals under him had like the magma  magma fruit and the glint glen fruit the  fruit lets sengoku turn into a giant  golden buddha we can assume his strength  increases to match his giant size we  know little of the fruit for instance we  don't know if sengoku used his hybrid or  full zone transformation at marineford  and we don't know if sengoku had to  awaken his golden form like luffy had to  awaken gear 5. at the very least the  idea of awakening it would go well with  the buddhist idea of enlightenment  however we luckily did get to see the  golden buddha form in action not only  are his physical attacks strong they  hurt luffy even if he puffs up his body  but he can also release golden colored  shock waves that appear to seriously  hurt the blackbeard pirates the cool  thing about this attack is that you can  attack as we saw multiple opponents at  the same time in the anime we even saw  that the golden shock waves are powerful  enough to clash with slash hold off  blackbeard's guru guru no me shockwaves  since the guru gura naomi is considered  the strongest paramecia fruit you can't  deny that the ability to counter it is  fitting for a god fruit the other  confirmed mythical zone fruits although  great in their own right wouldn't  necessarily make it into the mythical  god food category for instance i  wouldn't put the hitohito no me model  onyudo aka the human human fruit model  onyudo here which is onimaru's fruit  because the fruit is based on a youkai  aka supernatural spirit in japanese  folklore but not a god same with  orochi's heavy hebi no me model yamata  no rochi or snake snake fruit model 8  headed serpent which is a legendary  creature but even in its own myth the  actual god in it is the shinto storm god  susanoo a name you may well remember  from naruto and similarly with the other  mythical zones not mentioned here they  would fall more so into the mythical  creature or spirit category than the god  category obviously this is not an  official category yet and may never be  but i think it's a useful one and makes  the actual most op mythical zone fruits  seem rarer and more special and although  we don't have any other confirmed god  fruits i have made videos about  potential other god fruit users in one  piece so let's look at some of those now  blackbeard would be an obvious choice  now there are multiple theories around  having a mythical zone but my favorite  and the one i came up with in my  blackbeard already has a mythical zone  fruit video is the idea of blackbeard's  darkness logia actually being a darkness  or knight or moon god mythical zone to  match luffy's own sun god fruit check  out the video for full details and  quotes that support this theory but to  keep things short if luffy's fruit could  be mislabeled all this time it's likely  that his main antagonists could be as  well the parallels between these two  have been focused on for a long time  with blackbeard representing darkness  and luffy the sun and even their fruits  look very similar having the same color  and spirals once you look at all the  evidence including the fact that  blackbeard's fruit is consistently  stated to be weird for a logia this  theory starts to make a lot of sense and  i'll honestly be a bit disappointed if  it doesn't turn out to be the case  another theory is the one outlined in my  zorro already has a devil fruit video  link in the description people who  didn't watch the video were quick to  comment but he can't swim however the  point of the video is not that zoro  himself ate a devil fruit it's that enma  could have the god of the underworld  devil fruit and so zorro has access to a  god fruit through his sword obviously  this would still let him swim no problem  i won't go into all of the reasons this  theory makes sense here again but it has  a lot to do with how enma is spoken of  in the series in very similar terms to  the way zones are spoken of and also the  way it does things that haven't been  