 category yet and may never be  but i think it's a useful one and makes  the actual most op mythical zone fruits  seem rarer and more special and although  we don't have any other confirmed god  fruits i have made videos about  potential other god fruit users in one  piece so let's look at some of those now  blackbeard would be an obvious choice  now there are multiple theories around  having a mythical zone but my favorite  and the one i came up with in my  blackbeard already has a mythical zone  fruit video is the idea of blackbeard's  darkness logia actually being a darkness  or knight or moon god mythical zone to  match luffy's own sun god fruit check  out the video for full details and  quotes that support this theory but to  keep things short if luffy's fruit could  be mislabeled all this time it's likely  that his main antagonists could be as  well the parallels between these two  have been focused on for a long time  with blackbeard representing darkness  and luffy the sun and even their fruits  look very similar having the same color  and spirals once you look at all the  evidence including the fact that  blackbeard's fruit is consistently  stated to be weird for a logia this  theory starts to make a lot of sense and  i'll honestly be a bit disappointed if  it doesn't turn out to be the case  another theory is the one outlined in my  zorro already has a devil fruit video  link in the description people who  didn't watch the video were quick to  comment but he can't swim however the  point of the video is not that zoro  himself ate a devil fruit it's that enma  could have the god of the underworld  devil fruit and so zorro has access to a  god fruit through his sword obviously  this would still let him swim no problem  i won't go into all of the reasons this  theory makes sense here again but it has  a lot to do with how enma is spoken of  in the series in very similar terms to  the way zones are spoken of and also the  way it does things that haven't been  seen thus far from swords it not only  has a will of its own but acts on its  own while zorro tries to tame it and  remember that time when zorro saw the  personification of death and everybody  thought what was that yeah that could  have been the god of the underworld and  perhaps a sign that zorro has awakened  the fruit or is close to it then there's  monkey the dragon if anyone deserves a  god fruit it's this legend it's already  been all but confirmed that his devil  fruit allows him to manipulate wind and  more generally the weather something  that kaido was able to do as a dragon  god i outlined all of this in more  detail in my luffy's that is stronger  than you think video if you're  interested but for the sake of this  video let's go back to the azure dragon  myth the azure dragon which kaido's  fruit is based on is just one of four  dragon gods each of which is associated  with a different direction the oswar  dragon is east while the black dragon is  north the black dragon out of the others  best fits monkey the dragon not only  because he has black hair but also  because the black dragon is also called  the dark dragon or mysterious dragon  both adjectives that fit dragon's  character well if he were to have this  fruit it would easily explain how he was  able to summon both the wind and  lightning that allowed luffy to escape  from buggy and smoker back in the day  and you know his name is dragon which  could be a not so subtle clue although  i'm sure there are people who would say  oda giving a dragon fruit to a guy named  dragon would be two on the nose but  that's why we covered the confirmed god  throughs first and these final possible  god fruits were more so for fun and to  get the brain juices flowing let me know  if you have any other ideas for who  could have a god fruit it definitely  wouldn't surprise me if someone as  important as imu sama had one now  channel the pirate king within and smash  that like button if you enjoyed this one  piece video and want to keep them coming  be a smashing pirate king rather than  passing orochi and rumor has it you'll  get fireworks straight from mono to your  screen let me know what god fruit you'd  want to possess if you had one and who  your favorite god fruit user is make  this the video subscribe if you haven't  already and hit that notification bell  to turn on all notifications or you will  miss future one-piece videos and updates  and while you wait for the next chapter  to drop feel free to check out my giant  and growing one-piece playlist that  includes all the videos i mentioned in  this video and much more link to that is  in the description and on screen now  thank you so much for watching and until  next time see ya space cowboys
 

